menu "B-T HOME application"
    config BTH_WEB_RELAY_ENABLED
        bool "Enable relay and authenticated web control"
        default y
        help
            Runs the relay control page over a Wi-Fi AP, or optional Matter Wi-Fi.
            Relay GPIO and polarity must be specified by the board profile.
    config BTH_LOOP_INTERVAL_MS
        int "Module polling interval (ms)"
        range 10 1000
        default 20
        help
            All module tick callbacks run sequentially in the application task.
            Keep callbacks short; use a module-owned task for blocking I/O.
            Boards with ADC, BOOT or startup LED require at most 50 ms;
            application.cpp rejects slower polling for these profiles.
endmenu
